    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is that \"showing the lineage\" is exactly what they want. they want it to look like a coincidence or \"influence\" so they don't have to pay credit or royalties. it wasn't an accident. i have files and demo tapes from those years that prove i was doing this before anyone else even knew the genre existed. they basically conspired to bury me so they could sign cheaper, more compliant artists who would use the same sounds without questioning the origin. if i just show \"similarities\" i'm letting them off the hook. i need something much stronger. i need a manifesto that actually calls out the gatekeeping and the theft. how can i frame this so people realize the entire current scene is built on a lie of my making?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
